cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite the associated manuscript and this software release."
title: "Lateral packing of imbricated blades governs species-dependent bacterial suppression on ball python scales: model and analysis code"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Mechanistic model and reproducibility package for evaluating how the imbricated,
  tapered blade arrays on Python regius scales influence species-dependent bacterial
  suppression. The release includes model code, simulation outputs, numerical checks,
  sensitivity analyses, manuscript figures and table-generation scripts.
authors:
