    given-names: Antonio
    affiliation: "Signal Processing Laboratory, Federal University of Pará, Belém, Brazil"
keywords:
  - bacterial adhesion
  - biofilm
  - biomimetic surfaces
  - Python regius
  - surface topography
  - mechanistic modelling
  - uncertainty quantification
